// Ki Impact - a single heavy blow (Occult Impaction 266, Raging Thrust 273, Palm
// Strike 370, Tiger Fist 371, Ki Explosion 1016 retinted by its descriptor). The
// reference is sound plus a quake for most of these; here a white-gold core
// flash and glint detonate on the victim, twelve shock lines blow outward, a
// flat shock crosses the ground and dust kicks up. ~0.75s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
